 on the line.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of music that is not limited to the genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astra Moment:DIMENSION updates selected songs through a contest held by the Department of Practical Music at Jeonghwa Arts University. Play satisfactory with new and attractive songs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranking Leaderboard Competition System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the play is completed, the user's rating will be aggregated according to the unique system of Astra Moment:DIMENSION. The aggregated information can be checked by the ranking leaderboard, which can check the records of other competitors.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Jeonghwa Arts College","Kim HyeonJoong","Jeong HanHee","Ha HyeonJun"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034050/header.jpg?t=1755875880","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3034050/1681387525/a589b6612da7e1b7560ffebf282011460dd76008/1750959672/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754614845","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3034050/1681387525/a589b6612da7e1b7560ffebf282011460dd76008/1750959672/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754614845","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3034050/1681387525/a589b6612da7e1b7560ffebf282011460dd76008/1750959672/hls_264_m